\begin{remark}[Projective neckpinch]
\label{rem:chow-ii-appd-projective-neckpinch}
\source{chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-ii:page-0390}
\uses{thm:chow-ii-appd-neckpinch-asymptotics}
\dcref{appD:D.13}
\group{Rotational Neckpinches}


Under the reflection-symmetric hypotheses, the flow descends to
$\mathbb{RP}^n$, where the singularity forms along an
$\mathbb{RP}^{n-1}$.
\end{remark}

